    "The paper's dose quantity is CARI-7A ICRP-103 effective dose; BADGE reports PARMA's ICRP-116 isotropic effective dose. Related but not identical definitions.",
    "WSSS-KEWR and KEWR-WSSS were flown as different real routings (Pacific vs Atlantic side) in the paper. A great-circle model returns one identical path for both directions, so one of the two will always deviate.",
    "BADGE holds the UTC date constant across the flight; the paper's flights also span more than one calendar day."
